---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="findthat wrap" id="small-example" aria-labelledby="findthat-heading">
  <div class="findthat-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">Recorded private-archive example · 18 September 2026</p><h2 id="findthat-heading">A small clue.<br />A checkable correction.</h2></div><p>Why did a screenshot rule change? A saved search inside an already-known technical review recovered the reason, then led back to the corrected source.</p></div>
  <p class="findthat-scope"><strong>One known review, one narrow search.</strong> This example does not demonstrate finding an unknown session across the whole archive. Everything below inspects saved material; this page has no archive connection.</p>
  <ol class="findthat-stages" aria-label="Recorded lookup and source check">
    <li><span class="findthat-number">01</span><h3>The clue</h3><p class="findthat-query">“screenshot staging”</p><p>A read-only message search, scoped to the known review, selected one archived finding.</p></li>
    <li><span class="findthat-number">02</span><h3>The decision</h3><p>Keep the destination assigned by the task. Only save elsewhere first when the chosen screenshot tool requires it.</p><p class="findthat-small">The old blanket staging rule assumed every tool had the same restriction.</p></li>
    <li><span class="findthat-number">03</span><h3>The source check</h3><p>The review led to historical records of a successful source patch and a separate reread of the corrected files.</p><p class="findthat-small">Helm v1.0.0 · <code>666911e</code></p></li>
  </ol>
  <details class="findthat-details"><summary>Read the corrected source <Icon name="plus" /></summary><div><p class="findthat-source">Selected excerpt · <code>riders/output-file.md</code> · Helm v1.0.0</p><blockquote>Follow the selected tool's actual output-path restrictions. If it cannot save to the assigned directory, save to a permitted location and copy the result to the assigned directory before reporting its final path.</blockquote><p>This wording was checked against the exact tagged commit <code>666911e</code>, alongside <code>protocol.md</code>. The repository is private, so the selected excerpt is shown here.</p><a href="/features/helm/">How Helm handles delegated review <Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></a></div></details>
  <details class="findthat-details"><summary>What the evidence establishes <Icon name="plus" /></summary><div><p>The archive lookup recovers the technical finding. Historical tool records separately show the source correction succeeded and the reviewer reread it. The tagged Git source provides an independent check of the final wording.</p><p>This was source review, not a runtime screenshot test. It does not establish current installation on any machine. The captain and reviewer were agents; this is not evidence of human approval.</p><p>Selected result summaries are paraphrased. Original conversation titles, identifiers, paths and surrounding private context are omitted.</p></div></details>
</section>
<style>
.findthat{padding-block:38px 44px;border-block:1px solid var(--line);scroll-margin-top:24px}.findthat-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:38px;align-items:end}.findthat-intro h2{font:500 clamp(2rem,4vw,3.5rem)/1.12 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-top:14px}.findthat-intro>p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--muted);max-width:490px}.findthat-scope{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;padding:18px 0;margin:20px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted)}.findthat-scope strong{color:var(--forest-dark)}.findthat-stages{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 24px;border:1px solid #b6c1ab;background:#f4f5ed;border-radius:4px}.findthat-stages li{min-width:0;padding:24px;border-right:1px solid #c7cfbe}.findthat-stages li:last-child{border:0}.findthat-number{font:italic 23px var(--serif);color:var(--rust)}.findthat-stages h3{font-size:20px;margin:15px 0 12px}.findthat-stages p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--muted)}.findthat-stages .findthat-query{font:500 21px/1.5 var(--serif);color:var(--forest-dark);margin-bottom:10px}.findthat-stages .findthat-small{font-size:13px;margin-top:12px}.findthat-details{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.findthat-details:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.findthat-details summary{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;min-height:56px;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:550;gap:20px}.findthat-details summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.findthat-details>div{max-width:850px;padding:2px 0 24px}.findthat-details p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px}.findthat-details blockquote{margin:14px 0 20px;padding:18px 22px;border-left:3px solid var(--forest);background:#e9eedf;font:500 19px/1.65 var(--serif);color:var(--forest-dark)}.findthat-details a{display:inline-flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;min-height:44px;font-size:14px}.findthat :global(.ui-icon){width:18px;height:18px;flex-shrink:0}.findthat-details[open] summary :global(.ui-icon){transform:rotate(45deg)}.findthat code{font-size:.9em;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.findthat summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--forest);outline-offset:4px}
@media(max-width:700px){.findthat{padding-block:28px 34px}.findthat-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px}.findthat-intro>p{font-size:16px}.findthat-stages{grid-template-columns:1fr}.findthat-stages li{padding:20px;border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid #c7cfbe}.findthat-stages h3{margin-top:8px}.findthat-stages p{font-size:14px}.findthat-details blockquote{font-size:18px;padding:16px}.findthat .eyebrow{font-size:11px;line-height:1.7}.findthat-scope{font-size:13px}}
</style>
